<title>FRANCE: Three ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>Three ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three ships are loading a total of 34,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour will be shipped to West Africa, Sudan and Yemen.</p>
<p>One more ship is expected in port very shortly to load 16,000 tonnes of flour to an unspecified destination.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
